      "file": "hsk2_sc045_line_001.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我来得是不是太早了？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc045_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LIU_MEI_001",
      "textZh": "不会，大家还要十分钟才到。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc045_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我有一点儿紧张，不知道要不要发言。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc045_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LIU_MEI_001",
      "textZh": "不用每个人都说很多。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc045_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "那我可以先听吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc045_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LIU_MEI_001",
      "textZh": "当然。想说的时候再说。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc045_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "今天大家聊哪本书？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc045_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LIU_MEI_001",
      "textZh": "没有固定的一本，每个人介绍最近喜欢的内容。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc045_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "那我可以说我最近看的短故事。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc045_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LIU_MEI_001",
      "textZh": "很好，简单说为什么喜欢就可以。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc045_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "如果不知道一个词怎么办？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc045_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LIU_MEI_001",
      "textZh": "换简单的说法，或者直接问。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc045_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我常常因为想说得太正确而停很久。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc045_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LIU_MEI_001",
      "textZh": "交流的时候先把意思说清楚更重要。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc045_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这跟李娜说的一样。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc045_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LIU_MEI_001",
      "textZh": "看来大家都给你同样的建议。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc045_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "那我今天就少担心语法，多听多说。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc045_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LIU_MEI_001",
